WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.776 --> 00:00:15.062
<v><b>Presenter:</b></v> Hello, everybody, and welcome to today’s <i>What’s My Job?</i>

2
00:00:15.226 --> 00:00:25.674
On team A we have Nadine, Tyler, and James, and on the B team, Alice, George, and Charlie.

3
00:00:27.118 --> 00:00:33.652
Team A, you start. Today’s mystery guest is Mike.

4
00:00:34.218 --> 00:00:41.273
You each say who Mike is and what he does, but only one story is true.

5
00:00:41.749 --> 00:00:47.360
Team B, you need to decide who Mike really is.

6
00:00:47.583 --> 00:00:57.496
Remember, you have one minute to ask Team A questions, and then thirty seconds to ask Mike questions. Are we ready?

7
00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:07.736
So, let’s welcome Mike. Team A. Nadine, please introduce him.

8
00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:12.305
<v><b>Nadine:</b></v> Mike’s my hairdresser. We chat a lot.

9
00:01:12.573 --> 00:01:16.458
<v><b>Presenter:</b></v> And Tyler, please introduce Mike…

10
00:01:16.621 --> 00:01:20.357
<v><b>Tyler:</b></v> Mike’s my dentist. He’s a very good dentist.

11
00:01:20.402 --> 00:01:25.388
<v><b>Presenter:</b></v> And finally, James, please introduce Mike…

12
00:01:25.537 --> 00:01:30.255
<v><b>James:</b></v> Mike’s the chef at my local pub. I often have lunch or dinner there.

13
00:01:30.657 --> 00:01:37.905
<v><b>Presenter:</b></v> OK Team B. You have one minute to ask Team A questions.